• JiraFlowCoordinator owner
• JiraHtmlTemplateBuilder renderer
• ematchReport listener output
• JiraReportSteps controlled step logs
• JiraImagesEvidence controlled screenshot structure

It does not call Jira endpoints directly.
Its responsibility is only report data preparation.

