JiraImagesEvidence

JiraImagesEvidence is responsible for creating and organizing controlled screenshot evidence for the custom eMatch report.
It ensures screenshots are saved in the expected structure so the report can later show the correct image under the correct failed scenario.

Its main role is to decide between:

• Starting the evidence context for the current test case
• Saving manual evidence when explicitly requested
• Saving automatic failure evidence when a test fails
• Creating a predictable folder structure for screenshots
• Returning file names and paths in a report-friendly format
• Keeping screenshots separated by test case to avoid cross-matching

⸻

🏗️ Position in the architecture

